<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Username Setup - Tor-AI</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>회원 정보 설정</h1>
            <p>사용하실 닉네임을 설정해 주세요.</p>
        </header>
        <main>
            <form action="/setup-username" method="POST" class="setup-form">
                <div class="input-group">
                    <label for="username">닉네임</label>
                    <input type="text" id="username" name="username" required minlength="2" maxlength="20" placeholder="닉네임을 입력하세요">
                </div>
                <% if (locals.error) { %>
                    <p class="error"><%= error %></p>
                <% } %>
                <button type="submit" class="main-btn">저장 및 시작하기</button>
            </form>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
